#
# File: 240-ARP-Duplicate-address-claim-out-drop.rule
# Policy: Drop outgoing ARP claims for the local IPv4 address with an unexpected hardware address
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     Enforces the configured local IP/MAC binding; virtual MACs and failover require exceptions.
#     Direction: local-to-remote; intended for arp output hook.
#
arp saddr ip $ZONE_INTF_ADDR arp saddr ether != $ZONE_INTF_MACADDR counter drop comment "local-to-remote Local IP MAC mismatch"
